* 2N5486 N-channel JFET model used by Q89-1 and Q89-3 in VFO S/A 80289.
*
* Electrical parameters copied from:
*   C:\Ham Radio\KiCad-Spice-Library\Models\uncategorized\
*   spice_complete\phil_fet.lib
*
* The source model name is 2N5486/PLP.  It is renamed 2N5486 here because
* the slash is not portable in every SPICE/KiCad model-name parser.
* No electrical parameters were changed.
*
* This model predicts about 12.3 mA at VGS=0 before series-resistance and
* finite-VDS effects.  That is substantially more plausible for this VFO
* than the library's separate Siliconix model with BETA=4m and VTO=-4 V.
* Model provenance as an original Philips factory characterization has not
* been independently established.

.model 2N5486 NJF(
+ VTO=-3.847
+ BETA=832.666u
+ LAMBDA=19.1513m
+ RD=5.71667
+ RS=5.71667
+ IS=203.601a
+ CGS=2.5p
+ CGD=2.38p
+ PB=1.48032
+ FC=0.5
+)
